    <string name="onboarding_optional_body">Some features ask for access when you turn them on, never before:\n\n• Usage access, for daily limits and insights.\n• Notification access, for silencing apps and the digest.\n• Contacts and calendar, if you want them in search or on home.\n\nSay no to any of these and everything else keeps working.</string>
