    <string name="privacy_full">Calm Launcher has no internet permission, so it cannot send anything anywhere. It has no ads, analytics, crash reporting or accounts.\n\nWhat it stores, only on this phone: your settings, favorites, names you gave apps, rules and schedules, notes and to-dos, a simple log of pauses for your insights, and digest notifications you chose to collect. Android\'s cloud backup is turned off for this app; use Export to make your own backup file.\n\nOptional access is requested only when you turn on a feature that needs it, and can be removed at any time in Android settings. \"Delete all data\" erases everything.</string>
